        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Investigation boundary\n\nThis task records the behavior that still needs browser proof. Pure graph-capture and capability helpers already have coverage. The missing evidence is the save transaction, cancellation and failure recovery, dirty-workspace safety, and real pointer drags for workspace capabilities and node handles.\n\nThe first draft is intentionally a contract review artifact. It does not claim that the runtime behavior is complete."
        }
      }
